Local slope = exponent theta in N ~ H^theta over [H_{i-1}, H_i].
near-square-form frac = fraction of sigma>3.5 fibers where F5 or F6 has
  powerful part >= sqrt(|form|)  (i.e. on a high layer of the Pell conic X^2-2n^2=k).
